@title Month-end close runbook
@subtitle Finance operations, Tallow & Brook Distribution
@author Controller
@date 2026-10-01

kpi Target | 5 working days | to close the books
kpi Books lock | day 5, 12:00 | Controller signs off | bad
kpi Controller | Marcus Eldridge

!!! The books lock at 12:00 on day 5. Nothing is posted after that without an approved reopen request.

## Calendar

table = day,tasks; 1,"Cut off sales and purchasing at 17:00; finish bank reconciliations"; 2,"Post accruals and depreciation; reconcile inventory to the warehouse count"; 3,"Eliminate intercompany balances between the three legal entities; reconcile payroll"; 4,Review variances; 5,"Controller signs off; books lock at 12:00"

## Before sign-off

- [ ] Every balance sheet account is reconciled.
- [ ] Any reconciling difference is under $50 or explained.
- [ ] Variances over 5% and over $10,000 each have a written explanation.
- [ ] Intercompany balances net to zero.
- [ ] The trial balance debits equal credits.

## If a deadline slips

1. Tell the Controller the same day.
2. Decide whether the slip delays sign-off. If day 5 will be missed by more than 1 working day, notify the CFO, Valentina Sokolov.
3. Do not post late entries after the lock without a reopen request signed by the Controller.
4. Record the cause in the close log.

## Contacts

